{"products": [{"id": "gid://shopify/Product/waterbarriertss590rparent", "handle": "waterbarriertss590rparent", "title": "WATERCADE\u2122 - Water Filled Barrier", "description": "Reliable Protection. Simple Setup. The WATERCADE \u2122 is a 5-foot water-filled barrier that is a flexible, safe, and fast-deploying solution for jobsite separation. Weighing just 50 lbs empty, it's easy for one person to handle. Once filled, it anchors down at 650 lbs for unmatched stability. Interlocking ends and a 90\u00b0 turn pin (included) allow smooth or angled layouts for any project. One Filler Cap and Drain Plug are included with each unit. Product Features Fillable Design: 50 lbs empty, up to 650 lbs when filled with water Size: 5 feet long \u2014 stackable and compact for transport or storage 90\u00b0 Turn Pin: Easy angle adjustment between connected units Heavy-Duty Plastic: Durable build with no rust, no splinters MASH Certified: Suitable for work zones and roadway applications Custom Options Available Colors: Standard in Orange &amp; White \u2014 ask about Red, Blue, or Custom Shades All customization requests require a call or inquiry submission. We\u2019ll help you configure the perfect setup. FILL OUT THE FORM BELOW FOR ANY SPECIFIC FREIGHT REQUESTS", "descriptionHtml": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial;\">\n<!-- Freight Info --><hr style=\"border: none;\">\n<!-- Protection Description --><strong>Reliable Protection. Simple Setup.</strong>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 1.5em;\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0;\">The WATERCADE<span>\u2122</span> is a 5-foot water-filled barrier that is a flexible, safe, and fast-deploying solution for jobsite separation. Weighing just 50 lbs empty, it's easy for one person to handle. Once filled, it anchors down at 650 lbs for unmatched stability. Interlocking ends and a 90\u00b0 turn pin (included) allow smooth or angled layouts for any project. One Filler Cap and Drain Plug are included with each unit.</p>\n</div>\n<hr style=\"border: none;\">\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 1.5em;\">\n<h4 style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">Product Features</h4>\n<div style=\"margin-left: 1em;\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0.3em 0;\"><strong>Fillable Design:</strong> 50 lbs empty, up to 650 lbs when filled with water</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.3em 0;\"><strong>Size:</strong> 5 feet long \u2014 stackable and compact for transport or storage</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.3em 0;\"><strong>90\u00b0 Turn Pin:</strong> Easy angle adjustment between connected units</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.3em 0;\"><strong>Heavy-Duty Plastic:</strong> Durable build with no rust, no splinters</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.3em 0;\"><strong>MASH Certified:</strong> Suitable for work zones and roadway applications</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<h4 style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\"> Custom Options Available</h4>\n<div style=\"margin-left: 1em;\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0.3em 0;\"><strong>Colors:</strong> Standard in Orange &amp; White \u2014 ask about Red, Blue, or Custom Shades</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-style: italic;\">All customization requests require a call or inquiry submission. We\u2019ll help you configure the perfect setup.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"globo-formbuilder\" data-id=\"OTQxOTY=\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><strong>FILL OUT THE FORM BELOW FOR ANY SPECIFIC FREIGHT REQUESTS</strong></span><br>\n</div>", "productType": "", "tags": [], "availableForSale": true, "featuredImage": {"url": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0587/7701/0241/files/SHOPIFY_WATERCADE_ORANGE_1.svg", "altText": "", "width": 900, "height": 1000}, "images": {"nodes": [{"url": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0587/7701/0241/files/SHOPIFY_WATERCADE_ORANGE_1.svg", "altText": "", "width": 900, "height": 1000}, {"url": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0587/7701/0241/files/SHOPIFY_WATERCADE_WHITE_1.svg", "altText": "", "width": 900, "height": 1000}, {"url": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0587/7701/0241/files/SHOPIFY_BLUE_WATERCADE.png", "altText": "", "width": 900, "height": 1