chool safety and crosswalk zones Event setup and perimeter control Utility crews and emergency services Rugged where it matters, customizable where it counts \u2014 our 28\" cones deliver the professional edge for every job.", "descriptionHtml": "<p>\u200e <strong>Built for Work Zones, Events, School Safety, &amp; More | Custom Branding &amp; Bulk Colors Available</strong></p>\n<h3>Versatile, Durable, and Built to Perform</h3>\n<p>Our 28\u201d traffic cones are designed for high-visibility safety in any environment\u2014from active work zones to event perimeters. Available in a wide range of colors and configurations, these cones offer the flexibility your crews and sites demand.</p>\n<h3>Options Available</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Multiple colors available:</strong> Orange, Lime, Blue, White, Red, Green, and more</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Reflective or non-reflective:</strong> Add high-intensity collars if needed</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Choose weight:</strong> Available in 7 lb or 10 lb bases</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Choose body style:</strong> Slim or wide for different use cases</li>\n<li>\n<strong>MASH Approved:</strong> Meets standards for use on roads and in work zones</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Custom Branding Available</h3>\n<p>Personalize your cones with <strong>company names, department IDs, or jobsite branding</strong>. Custom stenciling available for fleet consistency and professional presentation. <strong>Call our office for bulk pricing and branding support.</strong></p>\n<h3>Ideal For:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Construction and maintenance crews</li>\n<li>Traffic flow and parking control</li>\n<li>School safety and crosswalk zones</li>\n<li>Event setup and perimeter control</li>\n<li>Utility crews and emergency services</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Rugged where it matters, customizable where it counts</strong> \u2014 our 28\" cones deliver the professional edge for every job.</p>", "productType": "", "tags": [], "availableForSale": true, "featuredImage": {"url": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/f