 above , then click \u201cAdd to Cart\u201d or call our team for custom logo and name stenciling, volume pricing, rush delivery, or custom configurations.", "descriptionHtml": "<p><strong>ANSI/ISEA Class 3 Compliant | Ideal for Roadway, Utility, Construction &amp; Traffic Control Crews</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li>\ud83e\uddba <strong>Available in Lime (V155) and Orange (V255)</strong>\n</li>\n  <li>\ud83d\udd26 <strong>High-Visibility Reflective Striping (Front &amp; Back)</strong>\n</li>\n  <li>\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Sizes Medium\u20137XL \u2013 Bulk &amp; Custom Orders Available</strong>\n</li>\n  <li>\ud83d\udc77 <strong>Meets OSHA &amp; MUTCD Guidelines for High-Risk Work Zones</strong>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3>\ud83d\udd27 Product Overview</h3>\n<p>These Class 3 vests are designed for maximum visibility and durability in high-traffic and hazardous work zones. Whether you\u2019re directing traffic, working near roadways, or managing a construction site, these vests ensure workers are seen \u2014 and protected \u2014 day and night.</p>\n<hr>\n<h3>\u2699\ufe0f Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li>\n<strong>Reflective Striping:</strong> 2\" silver reflective tape on torso, shoulders, and back</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Material:</strong> Lightweight, breathable polyester mesh for all-day wear</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Secure Fit:</strong> Zipper front closure and reinforced stitching</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3>\u2705 Why Choose TSS Safety Vests?</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li>\n<strong>Trusted by:</strong> DOTs, utility companies, public works, and contractors</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3>\ud83d\udcde Ready to Order?</h3>\n<p><strong>Choose your size and color above</strong>, then click \u201cAdd to Cart\u201d or call our team for custom logo and name stenciling, volume pricing, rush delivery, or custom configurations.</p>\n", "productType": "", "tags": [], "availableForSale": true, "featuredImage": {"url": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0587/7701/0241/files/Hi-VisVESTS.png", "altText": "", "width": 90